# RTG scanline check (SCANCYC test builds): the generic play script, and a SNAP
# every 2 s from 42 s; after each SNAP the build steps to the next of the seven
# choices (Off, Hard 25/50/75, Blended light/normal/strong), then Off again; then
# HELP (back to the menu: RTGSHOT builds write AmiMSX:rtgshot.raw there).
include play.keys
42s SNAP 60
44s SNAP 60
46s SNAP 60
48s SNAP 60
50s SNAP 60
52s SNAP 60
54s SNAP 60
56s SNAP 60
58s HELP
